SUMMARY:Eureka Symphony: A Season of Light
LOCATION:Arkley Center for Performing Arts\, 412 G St
DESCRIPTION:Eureka Symphony’s holiday concert opens with Victor Hely-Hut
 chinson’s Carol Symphony\; after intermission\, Claire Bent sings a Han
 ukkah medley and holiday favorites. Free pre-concert talk at 6:30pm. Two 
 performances: Friday 12/4 and Saturday 12/5 at 7:30pm. Tickets $21–$54 
 plus $2 preservation fee\; two kids 5–12 free with each paid adult (not
  in Loge). Tickets & info\nhttps://www.visiteureka.com/event/eureka-symph
 ony-a-season-of-light/
URL:https://www.visiteureka.com/event/eureka-symphony-a-season-of-light/
END:VEVENT
