SUMMARY:Winter Open Studio at George Sennott Studio
LOCATION:George Sennott Studio\, 618 F Street
DESCRIPTION:George Sennott Studio opens its doors for a joyful season gath
 ering on Saturday\, December 5\, and Sunday\, December 6\, from 11 AM to 
 4 PM both days. Stop by to see pastel paintings\, watercolors\, cyanotype
 s and monotypes\, and pick up greeting cards for the holidays. Free admis
 sion.\nhttps://www.visiteureka.com/event/winter-open-studio-george-sennot
 t-studio-2026/
URL:https://www.visiteureka.com/event/winter-open-studio-george-sennott-st
 udio-2026/
