DTSTART:20261212T140000
DTEND:20261212T150000
SUMMARY:Victorian Holiday: 125th Anniversary Tea
LOCATION:Eureka Woman's Club\, 1531 J St\, Eureka\, CA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the club's 125th anniversary with a Victorian holida
 y tea. Doors open at 1:30pm and tea starts at 2pm. Enjoy sweet and savory
  tea fare by Wendy Chan\, with a vegetarian option\, plus a costume conte
 st with prizes\, festive carolers\, a fan language presentation and handm
 ade gifts for sale. Tickets are $50.\nhttps://www.eurekawomansclub.org/
URL:https://www.eurekawomansclub.org/
END:VEVENT
